
# For mainland China without OpenAI access, use Volcano Ark (Volcano Engine, OpenAI-compatible):
#   1) open console: 火山引擎控制台 -> 方舟 -> 开通管理, enable model doubao-1.5-vision-pro-32k
#   2) create an API key (UUID format) in 方舟 -> API Key 管理, put it in OPENAI_API_KEY
#   3) OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/v3
#      GAME_OPENAI_MODEL=doubao-1.5-vision-pro-32k (or your own inference endpoint ep-xxx)
